Start with a short intro that says who this is for and what they'll learn.

## First section heading

Write in plain language. Use **bold** for key points and [links](/articles/what-are-backlinks) to other articles.

Every article automatically ends with a "Book a Strategy Call" box, so you don't need to add one.
